\newlabel{fig:five_prompts}{{3}{3}{The prompt palette with five simultaneous prompts. Each numbered node represents a distinct text prompt; the crosshair position determines the per-prompt weights via Fréchet mean interpolation. The original paper supported at most three prompts}{figure.caption.7}{}}
